# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Cloudflare Pages — Redirects & SPA routing (production)
# Static files (assets, csv, sitemaps, robots, images) are served
# directly. Every other route rewrites to index.html (SPA).
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Legacy index.html → root
/index.html  /  301

# Strip any "www" subdomain to the apex (canonical host)
https://www.megatoolsx.com/*  https://megatoolsx.com/:splat  301

# SPA fallback — serves the app shell for client-side routes
# (Missing routes render the NotFound page, which is <meta noindex>.)
/*  /index.html  200
